{"id":"n56762-1-9","stage":5,"title":"반나절 · 半天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56762-1-9-1","ko":"여기서 윗마을까지는 얼마나 걸리죠?","zh":"从这里到上面的村子要花多长时间呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"윗마을까지는","meaning":"上村","explanation":"윗마을：上村；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"윗마을","audio":"/audio/0c44c45ac68684b5cee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69559","senseId":"1","lemma":"윗마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"윗마을까지는","audio":"/audio/813f75730057b2967710.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"걸리죠?","meaning":"花费，消耗","explanation":"걸리다：花费，消耗；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸리죠","audio":"/audio/55a1f83391aa2a118e04.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"0c44c45ac68684b5","term":"윗마을","zh":"上村","audio":"/audio/0c44c45ac68684b5cee9.mp3","entryId":"69559","definition":"位于上方的村子。","pronunciation":["윈마을"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"花费，消耗","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"需要消磨时间。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5a7069744a5541c36e70.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56762-1-9-2","ko":"걸어서 반나절 정도 걸려요. 버스를 타는 편이 좋아요.","zh":"步行的话大概需要半天左右。坐公交车会更好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"걸어서","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어서","audio":"/audio/ccc311521d028aa1de80.mp3"}},{"text":"반나절","meaning":"半天，半晌","explanation":"반나절：半天，半晌","readings":[{"term":"반나절","audio":"/audio/9b5bce676b82ac052dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56762","senseId":"1","lemma":"반나절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반나절","audio":"/audio/9b5bce676b82ac052dee.mp3"}},{"text":"정도","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려요.","meaning":"花费，消耗","explanation":"걸리다：花费，消耗；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"21","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려요","audio":"/audio/3a6b8daa75e77297aab2.mp3"}},{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스를","audio":"/audio/4ab439d0845f5096c8da.mp3"}},{"text":"타는","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；-는：将前面的动作或状态转